<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="obsidian-fragment">Obsidian Fragments</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>s are a new currency introduced with Protocol Twilight. There is a wide range of items available through this currency, meaning which items to prioritize are based on whatever the largest upgrade is for you specifically. Generally, you will want to aim for any item that has a higher item level. A lot of these item slots have a better alternative from Valor Points, Twilight Protocol dungeon drops, or the new trio of dungeons added in the Phase.<br/>
<br/>
