<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Warlock DPS in Pre-Raid</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78797/hood-of-the-faceless-shroud">
<img alt="Hood of the Faceless Shroud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hood of the Faceless Shroud</span></a> is overall the strongest head item we can get before entering raids, it is rewarded for doing Heroics on the Twilight Protocol difficulty. The main benefit is the fact that it is part of our Tier 13. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71421/flickering-cowl">
<img alt="Flickering Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flickering Cowl</span></a> has a slightly higher item level and can be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>, you probably first want to spend these on other items. If you are looking for a good head if you freshly hit level 85 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72839/cowl-of-highborne-sorcerors">
<img alt="Cowl of Highborne Sorcerors" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cowl of Highborne Sorcerors</span></a> drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=55419/captain-varothen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Captain Varo'then</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5788/well-of-eternity">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Well of Eternity</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Head Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86932/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a></div>
