<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78825/robes-of-the-faceless-shroud">
<img alt="Robes of the Faceless Shroud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of the Faceless Shroud</span></a> is our best option, it can drop or be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> from doing Protocol Twilight Dungeons. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77122/robes-of-searing-shadow">
<img alt="Robes of Searing Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Searing Shadow</span></a> has a higher item level but is not part of a set and we rather spend our weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> on bigger upgrades that won't be replaced as fast. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71284/balespiders-robes">
<img alt="Balespider's Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balespider's Robes</span></a> is part of our tier 12 set and can now be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72826/robes-of-fate">
<img alt="Robes of Fate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Fate</span></a> drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=54432/murozond">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Murozond</span></a> in the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5789/end-time">
<span class="tinyicontxt">End Time</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
