<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=54432/murozond">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Murozond</span></a>
<br/>
<span class="small-text">
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5789/end-time">
<span class="tinyicontxt">End Time</span></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71989/bracers-of-unconquered-power">
<img alt="Bracers of Unconquered Power" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Unconquered Power</span></a> is a newly tailored item, these are crafted with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71998/essence-of-destruction">
<img alt="Essence of Destruction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felfirenova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Essence of Destruction</span></a> so expect these to be expensive. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77324/chronoboost-bracers">
<img alt="Chronoboost Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chronoboost Bracers</span></a> has hit rating and a relatively high item level as well, note that it costs 1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78425/bracers-of-the-banished">
<img alt="Bracers of the Banished" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Banished</span></a> can be found in the Protocol Twilight Dungeons. Alternatively <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71265/emberflame-bracers">
<img alt="Emberflame Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emberflame Bracers</span></a> is a bind on equipped that can be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a></div>
