<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77159/clockwinders-immaculate-gloves">
<img alt="Clockwinder's Immaculate Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Clockwinder's Immaculate Gloves</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78776/gloves-of-the-faceless-shroud">
<img alt="Gloves of the Faceless Shroud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Faceless Shroud</span></a> is only a few item levels behind and easier to achieve by completing Protocol Twilight Dungeons. On top of that it is part of our Tier 13 set. Protocol Twilight Dungeons also have a chance to drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78466/gloves-of-liquid-smoke">
<img alt="Gloves of Liquid Smoke" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Liquid Smoke</span></a>. Similarly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71281/balespiders-handwraps">
<img alt="Balespider's Handwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balespider's Handwraps</span></a> also drops from these dungeons. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69945/don-tayos-inferno-mittens">
<img alt="Don Tayo's Inferno Mittens" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Don Tayo's Inferno Mittens</span></a> is a crafted pair of gloves that can be bought from the auction house. A possible cheaper option for those freshly dinged 85 is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72852/archivists-gloves">
<img alt="Archivist's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archivist's Gloves</span></a> rewarded for completing <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=30097/archival-purposes">
<img alt="Archival Purposes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archival Purposes</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a></div>
