<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77179/tentacular-belt">
<img alt="Tentacular Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tentacular Belt</span></a> is our new best pre-bis belt that requires 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78879/sash-of-relentless-truth">
<img alt="Sash of Relentless Truth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Relentless Truth</span></a> is a great but expansive alternative, it drops from the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> trash mobs and is bound on equipped. It can be crafted by a Tailor and bought from the Auction House. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78398/cord-of-the-slain-champion">
<img alt="Cord of the Slain Champion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Slain Champion</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71357/majordomos-chain-of-office">
<img alt="Majordomo's Chain of Office" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Majordomo's Chain of Office</span></a> both can be gotten in Protocol Twilight Dungeons, along with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72851/chillbane-belt">
<img alt="Chillbane Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chillbane Belt</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5844/hour-of-twilight">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Hour of Twilight</span></a>, making them attractive alternatives.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> &amp; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=84427/grounded-plasma-shield">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grounded Plasma Shield</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>)</div>
