<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71980/lavaquake-legwraps">
<img alt="Lavaquake Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lavaquake Legwraps</span></a> is our technical best option, but it will be expensive as it requires <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71998/essence-of-destruction">
<img alt="Essence of Destruction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felfirenova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Essence of Destruction</span></a> to be crafted. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78816/leggings-of-the-faceless-shroud">
<img alt="Leggings of the Faceless Shroud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Faceless Shroud</span></a> is easier to obtain alternative thanks to the Protocol Twilight Dungeons, along with that it is also part of our tier 13 set. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72802/time-travelers-leggings">
<img alt="Time Traveler's Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Time Traveler's Leggings</span></a> drops in the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5789/end-time">
<span class="tinyicontxt">End Time</span></a> making it excellent for catching up on gear as a fresh 85.<div class="box" data-level="null">
