<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet</h3>Feet is another slot where we can consider spending our hard-earned <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> namely on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77176/kavans-forsaken-treads">
<img alt="Kavan's Forsaken Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kavan's Forsaken Treads</span></a>. An easier alternative is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78457/janglespur-jackboots">
<img alt="Janglespur Jackboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Janglespur Jackboots</span></a> which drops in the Protocol Twilight Dungeons. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71023/coalwalker-sandals">
<img alt="Coalwalker Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Coalwalker Sandals</span></a> drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53691/shannox">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shannox</span></a> in  <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> but is a bind on equipped drop, making it a pre-raid option. Similarly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69954/boots-of-the-black-flame">
<img alt="Boots of the Black Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidmage_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Black Flame</span></a> can be bought/<wbr/>crafted but requires <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> materials.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52782/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Lavawalker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a> &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52769/enchant-boots-precision">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Precision" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Precision</span></a></div>
