<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Warlock DPS in Pre-Raid</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77088/opal-of-the-secret-order">
<img alt="Opal of the Secret Order" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Opal of the Secret Order</span></a> is our best option, which will last us well into the phase. It does cost 1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. Alternatively <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78382/petrified-fungal-heart">
<img alt="Petrified Fungal Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Fungal Heart</span></a> can be found in the Twilight Protocol Dungeons. A cheaper non-RNG option would be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71213/amulet-of-burning-brilliance">
<img alt="Amulet of Burning Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Burning Brilliance</span></a> which can be bought with 1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
