<img alt="Amulet of Burning Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Burning Brilliance</span></a></td>
