<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Warlock DPS in Pre-Raid</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="2-handed-weapons">2-Handed Weapons</h3>There are a lot of options from the new Twilight Protocol Dungeons. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78426/lightning-rod">
<img alt="Lightning Rod" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Rod</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71798/shoravon-greatstaff-of-annihilation">
<img alt="Sho'ravon, Greatstaff of Annihilation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_firelandsraid_d_03_stage2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sho'ravon, Greatstaff of Annihilation</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78486/titahk-the-steps-of-time">
<img alt="Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time</span></a> being the three most notable.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52774/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
