<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="offhand">Offhand</h3>Most off-hands are straightforward, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72829/orb-of-the-first-satyrs">
<img alt="Orb of the First Satyrs" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_430nightelf_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Orb of the First Satyrs</span></a> is the highest item level option and can be found on  <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=55085/perotharn">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Peroth'arn</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5788/well-of-eternity">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Well of Eternity</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71323/molten-scream">
<img alt="Molten Scream" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_firelandsraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Scream</span></a> can now be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Offhand Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52768/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
