<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wand">Wand</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77079/hungermouth-wand">
<img alt="Hungermouth Wand" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hungermouth Wand</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 700 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78399/finger-of-zonozz">
<img alt="Finger of Zon'ozz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Finger of Zon'ozz</span></a> can be found in the new Twilight Protocol Dungeons.  Alternatively <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71151/trail-of-embers">
<img alt="Trail of Embers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_firelandsraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trail of Embers</span></a> can be bought for 700 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
